<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>Travel service is the furnishing by a motor club of touring and travel aids and assistance, and may include any or all of the following:</p><p>(a)<span class="EnSpace"/>Road maps, touring guides, directories of accommodations for travelers, club periodicals, travel information, magazines, and brochures.</p><p>(b)<span class="EnSpace"/>Procuring travel tickets of all kinds and reservations for accommodations in connections therewith.</p></caml:Content>